'.\" -*- nroff -*-
.TH KAFS-V6 8 "2026-07-20" "kafs 0.4.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
kafs-v6 \- retired format v6 runtime placeholder
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kafs-v6
.RB [ --help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kafs-v6
is a temporary fail-closed placeholder for the retired format v6 runtime.
Operational requests exit without opening or mounting an image. Format v6
offline inspection has also been retired; recreate remaining experimental
images as format v7 images for use with
.BR kafs-v7 (8).
.PP
The placeholder command remains only to provide a deterministic retirement
diagnostic and is removed with the final packaged v6 command surface.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h ", " --help
Show the retirement notice and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Help was printed.
.TP
.B 2
An operational request was rejected because v6 runtime support is retired.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kafs (1),
.BR kafs-v7 (8),
.BR fsck.kafs (8),
.BR kafsdump (8)
.SH AUTHOR
kafs project.
